ding=\"lazy\"\n                  data-dm-bg=\"repeat\"\n                  alt=\"\"\n                  class=\"dm-bg-item\"\n                />\n              </div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"dm-diff-right\">\n              <div class=\"dm-right-inner\">\n                <div class=\"dm-diff-label\">\n                  <div><strong>Why Bfunded Wins</strong></div>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"dm-tabs\">\n                  <div class=\"dm-tabs-track\">\n                    <div class=\"dm-tabs-pill\"></div>\n                    <div data-dm-tab=\"plan\" class=\"dm-tab-btn is-active\">\n                      <div class=\"text-block-985\">The Gap</div>\n                    </div>\n                    <div data-dm-tab=\"raise\" class=\"dm-tab-btn\">\n                      <div class=\"text-block-986\">The Engine</div>\n                    </div>\n                    <div data-dm-tab=\"engage\" class=\"dm-tab-btn\">\n                      <div class=\"text-block-987\">The Moat</div>\n                    </div>\n                    <div data-dm-tab=\"repeat\" class=\"dm-tab-btn\">\n                      <div class=\"text-block-988\">The Team</div>\n                    </div>\n                  </div>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"dm-panels\">\n                  <div data-dm-panel=\"plan\" class=\"dm-panel\">\n                    <h2>\n                      <strong\n                        >DocSend Tracks Decks. <br />CRMs Track Emails.</strong\n                      >\n                    </h2>\n                    <div class=\"text-block-989\">\n                      Nobody runs the raise itself. Bfunded does. Finding who\n                      fits, tracing the warm path, timing the close: the actual\n                      raise still runs on founder grit and guesswork. We built\n                      the operating system that runs it end to end.\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"div-block-2069\">\n                      <a\n                        href=\"https://www.bfunded.io/raise\"\n                        target=\"_blank\"\n                        class=\"div-block-2053 biru w-inline-block\"\n                        ><div class=\"text-block-976\">Learn More</div></a\n                      >\n                    </div>\n                  </div>\n                  <div data-dm-panel=\"raise\" class=\"dm-panel\">\n                    <h2>\n                      <strong>End-To-End<br />Raise Platform</strong>\n                    </h2>\n                    <div class=\"text-block-989\">\n                      Raise pages built in minutes. Network mapped and ranked.\n                      1M+ investors matched by real signals. Outreach on\n                      autopilot. Founders close at the exact right moment \u2014 no\n                      agencies, no cold email, no guessing.\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"div-block-2069\">\n                      <a\n                        href=\"https://www.bfunded.io/raise\"\n                        target=\"_blank\"\n                        class=\"div-block-2053 biru w-inline-block\"\n                        ><div class=\"text-block-976\">Learn More</div></a\n                      >\n                    </div>\n                  </div>\n                  <div data-dm-panel=\"engage\" class=\"dm-panel\">\n                    <h2><strong>Capital Flow</strong></h2>\n                    <div class=\"text-block-989\">\n                      PitchBook sees rounds close. We see them form. Every raise\n                      on Bfunded writes signal nobody else has: who forwards a\n                      deck, who co-invests, who commits, and when. Ten years of\n                      raise operations trained it, and every new raise makes it\n                      smarter.\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"div-block-2069\">\n                      <a\n                        href=\"https://www.bfunded.io/raise\"\n                        target=\"_blank\"\n                        class=\"div-block-2053 biru w-inline-block\"\n                        ><div class=\"text-block-976\">Learn More</div></a\n                      >\n                    </div>\n                  </div>\n                  <div data-dm-panel=\"repeat\" class=\"dm-panel\">\n                    <h2>\n                      <strong class=\"bold-text-23\"\n                        >Built By<br />Raise Operators</strong\n                      >\n                    </h2>\n                    <div class=\"text-block-989\">\n                      Every person on our leadership team brings 7+ years in\n                      cutting-edge startups and fundraising. Co-founders Will\n                      Diricco (2x exited founder, ex-Amplitude, top 3 YC) and\n                      Anthony Cargill (10 years scaling startups, AI unicorn\n                      advisor)\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"div-block-2069\">\n                      <a\n                        href=\"https://www.bfunded.io/raise\"\n                        target=\"_blank\"\n                        class=\"div-block-2053 biru w-inline-block\"\n                        ><div class=\"text-block-976\">Learn More</div></a\n                      >\n                    </div>\n                  </div>\n                </div>\n              </div>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </section>\n      <section class=\"testimonial-section\">\n        <div class=\"w-layout-blockcontainer container-365 w-container\">\n          <div class=\"dm-testi-slider\">\n            <div class=\"dm-testi-track\">\n              <div class=\"dm-testi-item\">\n                <div class=\"dm-testi-inner\">\n                  <div class=\"dm-testi-background\">\n                    <img\n                      src=\"https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6